# CaledonEngine gitignore settings

# User-specific Visual Studio options & caches
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# C++ Build & Intermediate Output Folders
[Bb]uild/
Intermediate/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
ipch/

# Dependency / Cache Artifacts
*.json
*.command
*.tlog
*.log
*.cache
*.recipe

# IDE / Code Editor Tooling
.vscode/

# --- Re-include vendored third-party libraries (SDL, SFML, etc.) ---
# These live under CaledonEngine/lib/ but contain folders named x64/x86/Debug/Release,
# which would otherwise get swallowed by the build-output rules above.
!CaledonEngine/lib/
!CaledonEngine/lib/**